{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f92213ed-777c-8213-b6c0-327d94706331",
  "created_at": "2026-02-06T13:36:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leila Nguyen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:31:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:31:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin, honey, can you hear me alright? I'm on my cell and it's not the best in my kitchen, so I might wander."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:32:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:32:14-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. I'm calling about the plowing. We got that little dusting overnight, hardly anything, but it's so cold out that it's all frozen down in the street. And my street never gets done until last."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:32:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:32:36-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kay Street. Four forty-seven Kay Street, up on the Hill. It's a dead end, so the plow gets to us after everybody else, if it gets to us at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:32:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four forty-seven Kay Street, got it. And you said it's a dead end. Is it the whole street that hasn't been touched?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:33:02-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The whole street, dear. [line breaks up] ...the corner there, it's a bit cleared, but from [inaudible] down to the end it's just packed and icy. Sorry, did I lose you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:33:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up a little. You said the corner has some clearing but the rest down to the end is packed and icy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:33:30-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. I came out this morning, it was still dark yet, and I couldn't see a thing on the walk. I only found out last month my phone has a flashlight on it. Fifty-odd years of life and nobody told me. So I held it up and picked my way down the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:33:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Handy feature. Well, glad you didn't take a spill. So is it the road you're concerned about, or the sidewalk too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:34:07-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the road. The sidewalks I can salt myself. But the cars slide at the bottom and there's nowhere for them to go, being a dead end and all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:34:22-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Let me put that down. Four forty-seven Kay Street, dead end, road still snow-packed and icy after the overnight dusting, plow hasn't come through past the corner. Does that sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:34:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's exactly it. And would you put in that it's always last? I'd like it written down that it's always the last street they do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:34:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll note that it's a dead end that tends to get plowed last. I'll log it and pass it to the crew supervisor so they know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. Will somebody come today, do you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:35:10-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise a time. With a light snowfall like this the crews usually work down the main roads first and then the side streets. But it's in the system now, so it's on their list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:35:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. That's fair enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:35:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want me to take a callback number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:35:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sure. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:35:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-two. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:35:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leila Nguyen. L-E-I-L-A, Nguyen, N-G-U-Y-E-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:35:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Leila. Anything else I can note on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:35:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's all of it. Thank you, Kevin, dear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:36:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Stay warm, and watch your step out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T13:36:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Bye now."
    }
  ],
